{"unit_id":"uluckystar__dsh-client-ui-side-tasks#card-zh","repo":"uluckystar/dsh-client-ui-side-tasks","commit":"bc0ce42b6e591ac34c513a7a0de45ed263551543","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Side Tasks 是面向网页客户端的侧边任务插件。在主会话标题栏加入任务入口和数量提示，并在页面覆盖层显示当前会话的任务列表与对话面板。宿主能力可用时，它会从主会话 fork 子会话，提供独立任务消息的发送、停止、历史查看与删除，并按活动时间管理一小时闲置清理；任务关联信息保存在浏览器本地。适合希望把临时工作拆到独立子会话、又想从主对话旁快速切换的人。目标 DSH 需提供历史与删除能力，缺少时新建和删除会被禁用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:82-123","src/client/controller.ts:295-390","src/client/store.ts:63-91"]}
{"unit_id":"uluckystar__dsh-client-ui-side-tasks#card-en","repo":"uluckystar/dsh-client-ui-side-tasks","commit":"bc0ce42b6e591ac34c513a7a0de45ed263551543","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Side Tasks adds a task button and panel to the web client. It uses host-supported child sessions to keep temporary work separate, with controls to read, send, and stop task messages. Task references are stored locally. Hosts without history or deletion support disable task creation and deletion.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:82-123","src/client/controller.ts:295-390","src/client/store.ts:63-91"]}
