{"unit_id":"uluckystar__dsh-client-ui-side-tasks#feature-1","repo":"uluckystar/dsh-client-ui-side-tasks","commit":"bc0ce42b6e591ac34c513a7a0de45ed263551543","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Side Tasks 的功能「侧边任务面板」：在会话标题栏提供任务入口和数量标记，打开后显示当前主会话关联的子任务。用户可收起为角落中的任务数提示，再展开面板。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:82-106","src/client/SideTaskPanel.tsx:194-209"]}
